        "true": [
          {
            "id": "a28c37b4-ee11-43a5-a7f3-2cac07744f54",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Survey: The north\nwall borders a\nbedroom. The east\nwall borders the",
                "kitchen. The south\nservice wall meets\nthe public pipe\nchase. Only",
                "the SOUTH path\nreaches the chase\nentirely within\nthe recorded",
                "service easement.\nThe old hatch is\nalready there."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "9c616d4d-aa6c-445b-a3e1-5a9fa29c6384",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "979cbd88-ae68-46ae-af51-f447e1b9a100",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The south chase\nhas two fitting\npositions.\nPosition A needs a\nnew",
                "hole through a\nprivate kitchen\nwall. Position B\nuses the existing",
                "service hatch and\ncosts one extra\nelbow joint. Both\nstay within the",
                "pressure rating,\nand the city fund\ncovers either\njoint count. The",
                "signed permission\ncovers only the\nexisting hatch.\nRivet says a",
                "cheaper pipe does\nnot become cheaper\nif it buys an\nargument with a",
                "tenant."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "b896540a-d79d-4ffd-aa5a-e9be73cbafd3",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "1e2fe321-f804-4362-afc2-5f5aef406fa5",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which existing\nhatch reaches the\npipe chase without\nentering a",
                "private room?"
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0b1bde08-c9d5-4198-a8a1-e8dbbec0f570",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
