      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "206fc494-44f1-422f-a930-7a23fd1f2393",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Slush checks the\nline with his own\nruler. The second\ndoor does not",
                "remove his wheel.\nIt prevents his\nwheel from being\nthe only door. He",
                "asks Dot to\nexplain what fails\nif the bypass\nfreezes too."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2dbf3329-3324-44f1-a663-fe9cccd13dee",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "758e0869-ba9b-4534-ac42-c89eab63e5e6",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Which fitting\nposition is ready\nto authorize under\nthe agreement you",
                "already hold?\nNeither option\nneeds your\npersonal money.\nThe decision",
                "is about matching\nwork to its legal\nand physical\nboundary. Slush\ncan",
                "grant a new\nkitchen-wall\nagreement later if\nthe tenant\nconsents, but",
                "that permission\ndoes not exist now\nand should not be\nassumed."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c79de0de-3343-4406-a8dd-7c79a2cb3703",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "09ffef4a-7791-457f-a8a7-689548582dee",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Nib reads every\nlimit before\nanyone signs. The\npermission covers\nthe",
                "existing hatch and\npipe chase only.\nSlush adds his\nrepair invoice as",
                "a separate\nattachment. For\nonce, nobody tries\nto sell a corridor\nby",
                "calling it a\nlifestyle."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
